      "label": "Introduction",
      "default": "<p>Since completing her MA, Rachel has continued developing compostable sequins that are commercially viable, washable and made from natural materials. Along the way, she has worked with partners including the BioComposites Centre at Bangor University and the University of Leeds, supported by an Innovate UK Sustainable Innovation Fund project.</p><p>She has also worked closely with the Royal College of Art, the University of Leeds and the University of Bradford on an AHRC-supported Future Fashion Factory project to further refine biodegradable sequins and bring them closer to practical use.</p>"
